From 7bbb5a405a08e06dc80de7f6d32c39d2d38e5e5f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gwenael Treuveur <gwenael.treuveur@foss.st.com>
Date: Thu, 11 Apr 2024 17:13:03 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 113/140] remoteproc: tee: fix memory allocation when probing
 rproc

Memory allocation has to be done for tee_rproc_context.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/linux.git 641f583872ff425b65826f58aab31349863e3243 remoteproc: tee: fix memory allocation when probing rproc]
Change-Id: I98e254dd4251a472de42fb72ded5c6e2ee2fa8e5
Signed-off-by: Gwenael Treuveur <gwenael.treuveur@foss.st.com>
Reviewed-on: https://gerrit.st.com/c/mpu/oe/st/linux-stm32/+/374729
Reviewed-by: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
Reviewed-by: Gwenael TREUVEUR <gwenael.treuveur@st.com>
ACI: CIBUILD <MDG-smet-aci-builds@list.st.com>
ACI: CITOOLS <MDG-smet-aci-reviews@list.st.com>
Tested-by: Gwenael TREUVEUR <gwenael.treuveur@st.com>
Domain-Review: Arnaud POULIQUEN <arnaud.pouliquen@st.com>
---
 drivers/remoteproc/tee_remoteproc.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/remoteproc/tee_remoteproc.c b/drivers/remoteproc/tee_remoteproc.c
index 49e1e0caf8897..fbdbd9a7bf978 100644
--- a/drivers/remoteproc/tee_remoteproc.c
+++ b/drivers/remoteproc/tee_remoteproc.c
@@ -332,8 +332,8 @@ static int tee_rproc_probe(struct device *dev)
 	if (IS_ERR(tee_ctx))
 		return PTR_ERR(tee_ctx);
 
-	tee_rproc_ctx = devm_kzalloc(dev, sizeof(*tee_ctx), GFP_KERNEL);
-	if (!tee_ctx) {
+	tee_rproc_ctx = devm_kzalloc(dev, sizeof(*tee_rproc_ctx), GFP_KERNEL);
+	if (!tee_rproc_ctx) {
 		ret = -ENOMEM;
 		goto err;
 	}
-- 
2.51.0

